            source: 'The Portugal News', sourceUrl: 'https://www.theportugalnews.com/news/2026-07-03/algarve-tourism-invests-in-the-international-promotion-of-the-destination/1049794', sourceSnippet: '阿尔加维旅游宣传 — 葡萄牙新闻'
